                               mode=nginx_tls (pishfarz): posht-e nginx/443، tak-port hefz — transport-e server ws|wsmux (bedoon TLS، client khodkar wss/wssmux migirad)
                               mode=direct_ip: bedoon-e nginx roo-ye 0.0.0.0:<port> — ws|wsmux (bedoon ramz) ya wss|wssmux (TLS-e self-signed، aval: ratholectl ip-cert <IPv4>)
